@startuml CalculationSequence
title Calculation Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ProjectStorage as "Project / Inventory Storage"
participant CalculationService as "Calculation Service"
participant ParameterCatalog as "Calculation Parameter Catalog"
participant CalculationEngine as "Calculation Engine"
participant RunStore as "CalculationRun Store"
participant ResultStore as "CalculationResult Store"

User -> UI : Submit input and calculate
UI -> CalculationService : Calculate(projectId, setup, inventoryInput)
CalculationService -> ProjectStorage : Save / update current Inventory(status=draft)
ProjectStorage --> CalculationService : Saved Inventory

CalculationService -> ParameterCatalog : Acquire parameters for inventory scope
ParameterCatalog --> CalculationService : Resolved parameter set

CalculationService -> CalculationEngine : Calculate(setup, inventoryInput, parameterSnapshot)
CalculationEngine --> CalculationService : emissionsOutput + formulaVersion + parameterSnapshot

CalculationService -> RunStore : Create CalculationRun(status=succeeded, parameterSnapshot, formulaVersion)
RunStore --> CalculationService : calculationRunId

CalculationService -> ResultStore : Create CalculationResult(calculationRunId, emissionsOutput)
ResultStore --> CalculationService : calculationResultId

CalculationService -> ProjectStorage : Update Inventory(status=calculated, latestCalculationRunId, lockedYears)
ProjectStorage --> CalculationService : Updated Inventory

CalculationService --> UI : Calculation completed
UI --> User : Show result

@enduml
